Package: lgbstream
Title: Streaming LightGBM for Parquet Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Josphe", email = "josphe@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits LightGBM models on tabular data that is too large for
    memory.  A C++ Arrow reader streams Parquet record batches into the
    LightGBM C API; DuckDB backs the mlr3 data backend and directory sources.
    The full feature matrix is never materialised in R.  Includes an 'mlr3'
    learner and tidy verb-style helpers.
